OL,3,AKrakow shooting suspect has died in
OL,4,Ahospital, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities initially reported that the
OL,7,Fgunman had apparently been inspired by
OL,8,F"far-right ideologies", but have since
OL,9,Fsaid they are investigating any
OL,10,Fpossible motivation.
